data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"60f27ab4-0707-41b8-a778-bacfc98f1704","message_id":"3ae43ccf-dd47-4105-8935-e9b40cb0faa9","created_at":1793579290,"task_id":"a6991067-f8ee-4eed-bb21-145afa129b29","workflow_run_id":"ce01ce7d-efdc-4082-977a-d1ec204d68df","data":{"id":"58c47ef5-95dd-42d9-9dca-ebb40e493247","node_id":"parse_llm","node_type":"code","title":"解析老周的反应","index":9,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"raw":"老周瞥了眼杯垫，眉头一皱，眼睛瞪得溜圆。见我没动静，他骂了句：“你个铁柱，找死啊！”嘴硬心软地把假蟑螂藏好，心里却在盘算着怎么报复。\n\n{\"reply\":\"上次你干的好事我全记得，这回看你怎么收场！\",\"verdict\":\"记仇\",\"grudge_delta\":3,\"memory\":\"铁柱把假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下，老周骂了一句并把假蟑螂藏好。\",\"reply2\":\"下次我让你尝尝我的手艺！\"}","player":"铁柱","action":"把一只假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下","grudge_total":3,"knowledge":[{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"bf885f15-3b67-4de6-9b05-76efa1aff862","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.6080563369106115,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":1,"segment_word_count":170,"segment_position":3,"segment_index_node_hash":"8c436a2bf2492bf4754ccbb097a8d826e5c0e81f8579dcd2d53064e707d5783b","doc_metadata":null,"position":1},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"假蟑螂杯垫\n- 招式名：假蟑螂杯垫\n- 操作方式：把橡胶假蟑螂压在老周的杯垫下面，等他收盘子时翻出来。\n- 预期效果：老周吓得把托盘扔出去，杯子碎一地。\n- 老周的反应：嘴上骂骂咧咧，弯腰捡杯子时偷偷把假蟑螂塞进你外套口袋。\n- 反制手段：下次你点酒时，杯垫下面可能真有一只从后厨抓来的小强。\n- 危险度：★☆☆（吓人为主，但摔杯子要赔钱）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"7b31dfb4-6c7f-44f1-a441-0801cd964b8f","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5361488015418494,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":8,"segment_word_count":166,"segment_position":6,"segment_index_node_hash":"7976c0c6f6f32b9cf80253849a061ae544741c521dc7776b66c217c1c442c6f3","doc_metadata":null,"position":2},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"胶水杯底\n- 招式名：胶水粘杯底\n- 操作方式：在老周常用的玻璃杯底涂一层强力胶，粘在吧台上。\n- 预期效果：老周端杯子时端不动，用力一扯把杯子扯碎。\n- 老周的反应：盯着杯底看半天，认出是你干的，默默换了个不锈钢杯。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒一律用缺口的旧杯子，说是“配套”。\n- 危险度：★★★（可能割伤手，属于重点记仇项）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"6f581b0b-5fb5-4955-80e5-ddd030eded75","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5147881603692971,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":9,"segment_word_count":160,"segment_position":4,"segment_index_node_hash":"393d8e83e8adadae926b7cb0aed541c67b5b8719971ddf9d1953b153d2db3c03","doc_metadata":null,"position":3},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"盐当糖\n- 招式名：盐罐换糖罐\n- 操作方式：把老周做甜酒用的糖罐和盐罐对调。\n- 预期效果：整晚的甜酒都变成咸的，老周自己尝了一口后表情扭曲。\n- 老周的反应：沉默三秒，然后把那壶咸酒原价卖给你，说“不能浪费”。\n- 反制手段：从此糖罐上贴着你的名字，专供你一个人。\n- 危险度：★★☆（破坏一整晚的生意，账记得很牢）","summary":null}]},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"delta":3,"new_total":6,"reply":"上次你干的好事我全记得，这回看你怎么收场！","verdict":"记仇","threat":"冷脸","memory_text":"铁柱把假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下，老周骂了一句并把假蟑螂藏好。（怒气 +3）","kb_titles":"prank_compendium.md"},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.068657,"execution_metadata":null,"created_at":1793579293,"finished_at":1793579293,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

